 "about": "Hand labels for PU-4 calibration. 100 portfolio filings drawn with random.seed(2026) from the 420 in the fixtures, labelled from the exchange category, subject and one-line summary only, before the priority levels were written or tuned. Labelled by Claude (the coding model) under the definition below; a human pass would be the next step.",
